      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have seen that the avatar preview seems to be the avatar as it looked in editor during upload.  The expeected behavior IMO would be for the avatar to look as it would in-game with the default animators at their \"reset avatar\" state.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "631eba7f40fcb944b378d946",
      "author": {
        "_id": "6142bc91c830f70736b61114",
        "alias": "Secondary Swordtail",
        "aliasID": "65c27264ed6eefce4c18098a",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/6bf93c90cf04232e3ca702e116e0b634.png",
        "created": "2021-09-16T03:40:01.951Z",
