      "mergeID": "633339b793ca4857a2338f23",
      "mergedPostDetails": "If you select someone and view their avatar then open and close the menu they will apear to be falling in the preview.\nThis setup I found seems to do it each time on most 3.0 avatars I have tested it on\nFirst you click on a user to select them with the Quick Menu\nClick view avatar details to view it in the quick menu\nThen hit the expand to full menu button on the top right \nYou should see a preview of the targets avatar standing normally now hit escape\nOpen the Quick menu again and click avatars. \nThe last persons avatar selected will now be doing the falling pose as if they are not grounded anymore",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Avatar falling in new UI preview",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "631ab1567152e144b0a0dd8f",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think it is the same with this Tracked Bug Canny.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1237-in-avatar-detail-avatar-preview-shows-sleep-or-falling-animation-for-some-a",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
