      "mergedPostDetails": "If you open the avatar menu and then quickly enough switch to another menu and back to the avatar menu, some avatars go into their fall animation instead of their default resting state.\nTry to use the default Avatar \"Crackling Villager\" by DarnHyena (inside teh \"Public\" category) for recreation.",
